    "description": "A read-only SQLite SELECT on a base. Each table is a view named like the table, its columns named like its fields: select "Exercise", max("Weight") from "Sets" group by 1. The columns "_id" and "_created" (ms) exist too. Dates are YYYY-MM-DD text (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM with a time), checks are 0 or 1, a percent is its points (25 for 25%), a duration is seconds, a choices field is a JSON array of names (read it with json_each), a link reads as the text of the linked row. One page holds at most 200 rows and about 48 KB, text cut at 2,000 characters (cut counts the cells cut); next is the offset of the following page, null on the last. A query stops after 500 ms: aggregate or filter rather than page through a whole table.",
    "inputSchema": {
      "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
